      "id": "monitor",
      "name": "Monitor",
      "version": "1.9.0-alpha04",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/test#monitor-1.9.0-alpha04",
      "html": "<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Use <code>SystemClock.uptimeMillis()</code> instead of <code>System.currentTimeMillis()</code> in <code>MonitoringInstrumentation</code> so wall-clock adjustments (such as NTP sync) do not skew activity completion wait loops or idle timestamps. (b/578740191)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commits": null
